Why combine within components first?
The CBC and Demographic files should not be merged immediately after download.
A safer workflow is:

inspect every source independently;
separate supplementary records;
combine all primary CBC sources;
combine all primary Demographic sources;
validate both combined components;
merge the validated component datasets.

This keeps component-specific problems visible before the final join.

